  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 9 + 30 × 15 - 18 ÷ 6 = 274.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 18 and 9\n\nGiven: 9 + 30 × 15 - 18 ÷ 6 = 274\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 18 + 30 × 15 - __**9 ÷ 6**__ = 274\n\n⇒ 18 + __**30 × 15**__ - 1.5 = 274\n\n⇒ __**18 + 450**__ - 1.5 = 274\n\n⇒ __468** - 1.5**__ = 274\n\n⇒ 466.5 ≠ 274\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 30 and 18**\n\nGiven: 9 + 30 × 15 - 18 ÷ 6 = 274\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 9 + 18 × 15 - __**30 ÷ 6**__ = 274\n\n⇒ 9 + __**18 × 15**__ - 5 = 274\n\n⇒ __**9 + 270**__ - 5 = 274\n\n⇒ __279 -____ 5__ = 274\n\n⇒ **274 = 274**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 15 and 18\n\nGiven: 9 + 30 × 15 - 18 ÷ 6 = 274\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 9 + 30 × 18 - __**15 ÷ 6**__ = 274\n\n⇒ 9 + __**30 × 18**__ - 2.5 = 274\n\n⇒ __**9 + 540**__ - 2.5 = 274\n\n⇒ __549____ - 2.5__ = 274\n\n⇒ 546.5 ≠ 274\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 9 and 30\n\nGiven: 9 + 30 × 15 - 18 ÷ 6 = 274\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 30 + 9 × 15 - __**18 ÷ 6**__ = 274\n\n⇒ 30 + __**9**____** × 15**__ - 3 = 274\n\n⇒ __**30 + 135**__ - 3 = 274\n\n⇒ __165 - 3__ = 274\n\n⇒ 162 ≠ 274\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
